      {
       "text": "<p>In Brooklyn, Manhattan-bound [D] skips <strong>20 Av</strong>, <strong>18 Av</strong>, <strong>79 St</strong>, <strong>71 St</strong>, <strong>55 St</strong>, <strong>50 St</strong> and <strong>Fort Hamilton Pkwy</strong></p>",
