       "text": "<p>For service to these stations, take the [D] to \u200c<strong>62 St</strong> or <strong>9 Av</strong> and transfer to a Coney Island-bound [D].</p><p></p><p>For service from these stations, take the [D] to \u200c<strong>62 St</strong> or <strong>Bay Pkwy</strong> and transfer to a Manhattan-bound [D].</p><ul><li><p>At <strong>Bay Pkwy</strong>, <strong>62 St</strong> and <strong>9 Av</strong> trains board from the Coney Island-bound platform.</p></li></ul><p><strong>What's happening?</strong></p><p>We're replacing tracks</p>",
